add("## 4. SPI（SHUB_SSP0/1 = rspi0/1 @ 0xC088_5000/0x6000）");
add("**框架**：`include/nuttx/spi/spi.h` `struct spi_ops_s`(:553: lock/select/setfrequency/setmode/setbits/status/send[sndblock/recvblock]/exchange[CONFIG_SPI_EXCHANGE]/hwfeatures/cmddata/trigger/registercallback)，设备体 `spi_dev_s`(:598)。");
add("  **注册**：`spi_register(spi, bus)`(原型在 `spi_transfer.h:163`, `drivers/spi/spi_driver.c:333`→/dev/spiN)；helper `spi_transfer()`(`spi_transfer.h:138`)。**Kconfig**：`CONFIG_SPI`(Kconfig:26 menuconfig)、`CONFIG_SPI_DRIVER`(:227)、`CONFIG_SPI_EXCHANGE`(:113)。**参考**：`drivers/spi/spi_bitbang.c`(g_spiops:107)。");
add("**寄存器（esOS k1x_spi.h）**：`REG_SSP_TOP_CTRL=0x00`/`FIFO_CTRL=0x04`/`INT_EN=0x08`/`TO=0x0c`/`DATAR=0x10`/`STATUS=0x14`/`PSP_CTRL=0x18`/`NET_WORK_CTRL=0x1c`/`NET_WORK_STATUS=0x20`/`RWOT_*`。");
add("  关键位：`BIT_SSP_SSE=1<<0`(:50 SSP使能)、`SPO=1<<10/SPH=1<<11/LBM=1<<12/HOLD_FRAME_LOW=1<<14/SCFR=1<<16`；`BITS_SSP_DSS(x)=x<<5`(:46)；`STATUS`：`ROR=1<<20`(:83)/`RNE=1<<14`(:86)/`TNF=1<<6`(:91)/`BSY=1<<0`(:97)；`INT_EN`：`PINTE=1<<0/TINTE=1<<1/RIE=1<<2/TIE=1<<3`(:68-70)；`FIFO_CTRL`：`BITS_SSP_RFT(x)=x<<5/TFT(x)=x`；数据位宽 `(7<<5)/(15<<5)/(31<<5)`(8/16/32bit)。");
add("**初始化**：probe(:532) 设默认 `RFT/TFT=15`、8bit、装 `rspi0-irq`(:618)+umask；每笔 `k1x_spi_transfer_config`(:186) 清 `ROR|TINT`→清/置 `BIT_SSP_SSE`(:221-227)。");
add("**中断**：`rspi0-irq`(handler:467) 关 `TIE|RIE|TINTE`→PIO 续传→`tx/rx` 完成则完成；DMA 路径把 `DATAR` 当 src/dst(:305/314/328/337)。");
add("**验证（板载真器件）**：esOS `spi_test <0|1>`(0=固定频/1=扫频 812.5K~51.2M) → 读 JEDEC ID：发 `0x9F`、`send_then_recv(1, recv,6)`，打印 `jedec id: recv[0..2]`；随后 `0x06 写使能→0x20 擦扇区→0x04 写禁止→0x03 读回→写 0x55 图案(200B)→读回`，`sum==196`→“test ok”。⚠️ probe 确认 rspi0 所接 flash。");
add("**调试**：/dev/spiN 读 ID；GDB 看 `STATUS` 的 `TNE/RNE/BSY`；QEMU 用 spi_bitbang 校验逻辑。");
add("**集成**：`CONFIG_SPI+CONFIG_SPI_DRIVER`；`k1r_spi.c` 实现 `struct spi_ops_s`→`spi_register(...,0)`；板级挂 /dev/spiN。");
add("**参考**：esOS `spi/k1x_spi.c`+`k1x_spi_test.c`；K1 手册 ch16；`drivers/spi/spi_bitbang.c`。");
