add("## 8. 音频（I2S/SSPA + ADMA + ES8326 codec）——旗舰");
add("**框架**：");
add("- I2S：`include/nuttx/audio/i2s.h` `struct i2s_ops_s`(:304: i2s_rxchannels/rxsamplerate/rxdatawidth/receive/txchannels/txsamplerate/txdatawidth/send/getmclkfrequency/setmclkfrequency/ioctl)；宏 `I2S_SEND`(:227)/`I2S_RECEIVE`(:135)/`I2S_TXCHANNELS`(:154)/`I2S_TXSAMPLERATE`(:175)/`I2S_TXDATAWIDTH`(:194)。**注册是 `i2schar_register(i2s, minor)`(:396, `drivers/i2s/i2schar.c:401`)，⚠️ 无 `i2s_register`**。`CONFIG_I2S`(drivers/i2s/Kconfig:6 menuconfig)。");
add("- audio lower-half：`include/nuttx/audio/audio.h` `struct audio_ops_s`(:856: getcaps/configure/shutdown/start/stop/pause/resume/allocbuffer/freebuffer/enqueuebuffer/cancelbuffer/ioctl/read/write/reserve/release)、`struct audio_lowerhalf_s`(:1035: ops/upper/priv)、`audio_register(name,dev)`(:1107)。`CONFIG_AUDIO`(audio/Kconfig:6)。");
add("- 接入：`audio_i2s_initialize(i2s, playback)`(`audio_i2s.c:425`, config 写 `I2S_TX*/RX*`, enqueuebuffer 调 `I2S_SEND/RECEIVE`:350/354)；`audio_dma_initialize(dma_dev, chan_num, playback, fifo_width, fifo_addr)`(`audio_dma.c:570`)。`CONFIG_AUDIO_I2S`(:510)/`CONFIG_AUDIO_DMA`(:515)/`CONFIG_AUDIO_RPMSG`(:581)。");
add("**寄存器（esOS adma_service.c）**：K1 `ADMA_CHAN_ISR=0xc08838a0`(:21)/`ADMA_CHAN_IER=0xc0883880`(:22)/`ADMA_CHAN_IRQ=HDMI_ADMA_CH_IRQn`(:23)。dts `hdmi_adma @0xC0883800`，reg-names `adma_reg/ctrl_reg(0xC0882050)/buf_addr(0xC08D0000)`。");
add("**初始化/中断**：`rpmsg_adma_service_init`(:118) 起线程等 rpdev→`rpmsg_create_ept("adma-service")`(:101)；endpoint 收“startup”→写 `IER=0x1`(:62)+`metal_irq_register/enable(ADMA_CHAN_IRQ)`(:65/72)→回“startup-ok”(:74)；`adma_irq_handler`(:39) 清 `ISR`→`pending&(1<<0)`→sem→rpmsg 发“#”。");
add("**codec**：ES8326 @ I2C 0x19；参考 `drivers/audio/audio_es8311.c`/`audio_es8388.c`。");
add("**验证（纯板载·听）**：初始化 codec→播放 1kHz 音调/正弦→板载喇叭/耳机出声即通过；用 `pcm-audio` skill 校验 PCM 质量。");
add("**集成**：`CONFIG_AUDIO+CONFIG_I2S+CONFIG_DMA+CONFIG_I2C`(+`CONFIG_AUDIO_RPMSG` 用于大核下发 PCM)；`k1r_i2s.c` 实现 `struct i2s_ops_s`→`i2schar_register`；`k1r_adma.c` 实现 ADMA 通道；`board_late_initialize` 经 `audio_i2s_initialize`/`audio_dma_initialize` 或 `audio_register` 挂 /dev/audio。");
add("**参考**：esOS `adma/adma_service.c`；K1 手册 ch14/16；`drivers/audio/audio_i2s.c`、`audio_dma.c`、`drivers/i2s/i2schar.c`。");
